Rustica's wallpapers, in QOI (qoiformat.org), the format the compositor
reads. Any of them goes with any theme (Settings > Appearance).

  rustica-fox.qoi            Rustica fox, the default, landscape screens
                             (1672x941)
  rustica-fox-portrait.qoi   the same, portrait screens and the mobile
                             edition (529x941)
  dracula.qoi                liquid violet (1290x860)
  forest.qoi                 a forest at night (1024x1024)
  arctic.qoi                 aurora over ice (1044x860)
  sakura.qoi                 cherry blossom under the moon (1000x667)

The pictures were given to the project by its owner (the fox 2026-11-24,
replaced and joined by the others 2026-11-25) and turned into QOI with
scripts/make-wallpaper.py. Settings > Appearance turns another picture
(PNG, JPEG or QOI) into ~/.config/rustica/wallpaper.qoi.
